amai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2898900/extras/785f71c38ac5b881714207c8ffeb0b36.webm?t=1758719070\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2898900/extras/785f71c38ac5b881714207c8ffeb0b36.poster.avif?t=1758719070\" width=80 height=80 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2898900/extras/785f71c38ac5b881714207c8ffeb0b36.webm?t=1758719070\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2898900/extras/785f71c38ac5b881714207c8ffeb0b36.poster.avif?t=1758719070\" width=80 height=80 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2898900/extras/785f71c38ac5b881714207c8ffeb0b36.webm?t=1758719070\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2898900/extras/785f71c38ac5b881714207c8ffeb0b36.poster.avif?t=1758719070\" width=80 height=80 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2898900/extras/785f71c38ac5b881714207c8ffeb0b36.webm?t=1758719070\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2898900/extras/785f71c38ac5b881714207c8ffeb0b36.poster.avif?t=1758719070\" width=80 height=80 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2898900/extras/785f71c38ac5b881714207c8ffeb0b3